The unmistakable limestone ridge in the background topped by medieval towers is Monte Titano in San Marino. Because the smaller third tower (Montale) appears to the left of the second tower (Cesta), the view is looking west from the eastern slopes of the mountain. The Italian text "Carrozzeria Fiorina" on the yellow car further confirms the location near the villages of Fiorina, Domagnano, and Valdragone on the eastern side of San Marino.

